        79,
        131,
        877
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "EUELPIDES",
      "text": "Greetings, my dear Dikaiopolis, where are you going and where have you come from?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 2,
      "bbox": [
        134,
        88,
        153,
        127
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "DIK.",
      "text": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 3,
      "bbox": [
        134,
        189,
        175,
        892
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "From the Piraeus, my friend, and I am on my way to the assembly. It will be a sovereign assembly today.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stage_direction",
      "order": 4,
      "bbox": [
        178,
        188,
        196,
        735
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Meanwhile Peisetairos comes up, with a crow on his wrist.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 5,
      "bbox": [
        200,
        88,
        219,
        127
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "DIK.",
      "text": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 6,
      "bbox": [
        200,
        189,
        233,
        876
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Greetings to you too, Peisetairos, but where on earth are you going with that crow? Could it be that you are going to the crows?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 7,
      "bbox": [
        236,
        88,
        250,
        211
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "PEISETAIROS",
      "text": "Of course! We are leaving the country, our fatherland.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 8,
      "bbox": [
        253,
        88,
        269,
        127
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "DIK.",
      "text": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 9,
      "bbox": [
        253,
        190,
        294,
        899
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But why do you want to leave like this, my friends? Please tell me, for I would be very glad to know the reason.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 10,
      "bbox": [
        297,
        88,
        312,
        121
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "EU.",
      "text": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 11,
      "bbox": [
        297,
        189,
        338,
        856
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I will tell you. We are looking for a peaceful place. We shall go there, and when we get there, we shall settle in a peaceful city.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 12,
      "bbox": [
        340,
        88,
        355,
        127
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "DIK.",
      "text": "But why do you want to carry that crow on your wrist?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 13,
      "bbox": [
        358,
        88,
        372,
        121
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "EU.",
      "text": null,
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 14,
      "bbox": [
        358,
        189,
        399,
        869
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "This crow is guiding us, and we are following it. For who can lead us to the crows better than a crow?",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "passage_line",
      "order": 15,
      "bbox": [
        402,
        88,
        417,
        127
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "DIK.",
      "text": "He is certainly the best guide.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
